            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118266?u=5a7fb2f3d1ecc7dcd73f43f4b478cb4938e6572c&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 144 supported <code class=\"notranslate\">moveBefore</code>, alongside the <code class=\"notranslate\">connectedMoveCallback</code>. This updates the data to reflect the <code class=\"notranslate\">connectedMoveCallback</code> which was perhaps missed in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3422725499\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27902\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27902/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27902\">#27902</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
