        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF146 adds support for the MathML CSS <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/math-shift\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">math-shift</code></a> property in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1994171\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1994171</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3607745179\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41877\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41877/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41877\">mdn/content#41877</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28511",
            "title": "FF146 MathML - math-shift CSS property",
