        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF146 adds support for using non-registered symbols as keys for WeakMap and values for WeakSet in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966745\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1966745</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The issue only talks about WeakMap, but I ran a test for WeakSet and that behaves the same way:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"const ws = new WeakSet();\nconst sym = Symbol('foo');\nws.add(sym); \"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">ws</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">WeakSet</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">sym</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">Symbol</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'foo'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">ws</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">add</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">sym</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> </pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the subfeature.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3607691670\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41868\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41868/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41868\">mdn/content#41868</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28498",
            "title": "FF146 WeakMap/WeakSet use non-registered symbols as keys/values",
