            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17036061?u=becea1794942100f6fe2be3a310afc188b7bde2e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Safari 26.2 removed the UA styles for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;article&gt;</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;aside&gt;</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;nav&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;section&gt;</code>:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#Deprecations\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#Deprecations</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28473",
            "title": "Safari 26.2 removed UA styles in article, aside, nav, and section",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-17T22:01:10.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-17T22:00:34.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jdatapple",
                "url": "https://github.com/jdatapple"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17036061?u=becea1794942100f6fe2be3a310afc188b7bde2e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Safari 26.2 supports command/commandFor and invoker commands:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#HTML\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#HTML</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28472",
            "title": "Safari command/commandfor and invoker commands support",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-17T22:06:36.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-17T21:55:41.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jdatapple",
                "url": "https://github.com/jdatapple"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17036061?u=becea1794942100f6fe2be3a310afc188b7bde2e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Support for hidden=until-found was added in 26.2:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#DOM\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#DOM</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28471",
            "title": "Add Safari hidden=until-found support",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-17T21:29:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-17T21:29:05.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jdatapple",
                "url": "https://github.com/jdatapple"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17036061?u=becea1794942100f6fe2be3a310afc188b7bde2e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Safari supports partitioned cookies in 26.2:<br>\n<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#Privacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#Privacy</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28470",
            "title": "Update set-cookie partitioned for Safari",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-17T21:23:48.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-17T21:23:11.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jdatapple",
                "url": "https://github.com/jdatapple"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 142 adds support for the <a href=\"https://open-ui.org/components/interest-invokers.explainer/\" rel=\"nofollow\">interest invokers</a> feature. This provides a declarative way to signal interest in an element (for example, by hovering, focusing, or long-pressing it) and have a popover open as a result of that interest.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This feature includes the following subfeatures:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">interestfor</code> attribute, available on the HTML <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;button&gt;</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;area&gt;</code> elements, and the SVG <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code> element.</li>\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">InterestInvokerElement</code> property, available on the HTML <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;button&gt;</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;area&gt;</code> elements, and the SVG <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;a&gt;</code> element.</li>\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">interest</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">loseinterest</code> events, available on the <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLElement</code> interface.</li>\n<li>The <code class=\"notranslate\">InterestEvent</code> event object.</li>\n<li>The CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">interest-delay</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">interest-delay-start</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">interest-delay-end</code> properties.</li>\n<li>The CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">:interest-source</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">:interest-target</code> pseudo-classes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The CSS features are already specified and in BCD. The HTML and DOM features are not yet specified (see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2835336619\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11006\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/html/pull/11006/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11006\">whatwg/html#11006</a>); this PR adds them to BCD, marked as <code class=\"notranslate\">\"standard_track\": false</code> for now, until the PR gets merged.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28469",
            "title": "Chrome 142 interest invokers support",
